---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { NEWS_ATTRIBUTION } from '../data/news';
// TODO(client): confirm with your compliance advisor (SEBI status, wording).
---

<Legal
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Tradot Academy provides stock market education only. We do not offer investment advice, tips or guaranteed returns."
  updated="10 October 2026"
>
  <p class="callout">{site.disclaimer}</p>

  <h2>Education, not advice</h2>
  <p>
    All content on this website and in our classes, including examples, chart studies, strategies and discussions, is
    for educational purposes only. Nothing we publish or teach is a recommendation, solicitation or offer to buy or
    sell any security or financial product.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not provide investment advice, research recommendations, stock tips, portfolio management or trading
    signals, and we do not manage money on behalf of students.
  </p>

  <h2>Risk</h2>
  <p>
    Trading and investing in securities, including equities, futures and options, involves risk, including the
    possible loss of your capital. Past performance of any strategy, example or market is not a guide to future
    results. We make no promise or guarantee of profit or returns.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before trading, consider your financial situation and risk tolerance, and consult a SEBI-registered investment
    adviser if you need personalised advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Market news</h2>
  <p>{NEWS_ATTRIBUTION}</p>
  <p>
    Headlines are shown as published by their sources and may be delayed. We do not edit them and are not responsible
    for their accuracy.
  </p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    You are solely responsible for any trading or investment decisions you make. Tradot Academy, its mentors and staff
    are not liable for any losses arising from the use of information on this website or in our classes.
  </p>
</Legal>
